    the third thing is the skipfile of the thing
    and the nextrank of the fourth thing is the second thing.

a thing knightmove a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the skiprank of the second thing is the fourth thing
    and the thing is the nextfile of the third thing.

a thing knightmove a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the skiprank of the second thing is the fourth thing
    and the third thing is the nextfile of the thing.

a thing knightmove a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the skiprank of the fourth thing is the second thing
    and the thing is the nextfile of the third thing.

a thing knightmove a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the skiprank of the fourth thing is the second thing
    and the third thing is the nextfile of the thing.

