the move move with a file, a rank, a thing and a second thing is legal at a time if
    white is a control at the time
    and the file cell the rank with white at the time
    and the file knightmove the rank with the thing with the second thing
    and it is not the case that the thing cell the second thing with white at the time.

the move move with a file, a rank, a thing and a second thing is legal at a time if
    black is a control at the time
    and the file cell the rank with black at the time
    and the file knightmove the rank with the thing with the second thing
    and it is not the case that the thing cell the second thing with black at the time.

the goal of a role is a number at a time if
    the role is the capturecount of a count at the time
    and the scoremap of the count is the number.

the game is terminal at a time if
    41 is a step at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    a role is a control at the time
    and it is not the case that the role is a hasanypiece at the time.

a thing is a hasanypiece at a time if
    a file cell a rank with the thing at the time.

when the move capture with a role is made
    and the role is the capturecount of a count
    and the count countplus a thing
then the role is the capturecount of the thing
    and it is not the case that the role is the capturecount of the count.

when the move move with a file, a rank, a thing and a second thing is made
    and a role is a control
then the thing cell the second thing with the role
    and it is not the case that the file cell the rank with the role.

when the move move with a file, a rank, a thing and a second thing is made
    and a second role is a control
    and the thing cell the second thing with a role
then it is not the case that the thing cell the second thing with the role.

when the move move with a file, a rank, a thing and a second thing is made
    and a role is the capturecount of a count
    and the count countplus a third thing
    and the role is a control
    and the thing cell the second thing with a second role
then the role is the capturecount of the third thing
    and it is not the case that the role is the capturecount of the count.

when the move move with a file, a rank, a thing and a second thing is made
    and a third thing is a step
    and the succ of the third thing is a fourth thing
then the fourth thing is a step
    and it is not the case that the third thing is a step.

when the move move with a file, a rank, a thing and a second thing is made
    and white is a control
then black is a control
    and it is not the case that white is a control.

when the move move with a file, a rank, a thing and a second thing is made
    and black is a control
then white is a control
    and it is not the case that black is a control.

it must not be true that
    the move move with a file, a rank, a thing and a second thing is made
    and it is not the case that the move move with the file, the rank, the thing and the second thing is legal.

